msgstr "跳过有阶梯价格的产品"

#: src/Addons/Coupons/CouponsAddon.php:73
msgid "Tiered pricing"
msgstr "阶梯定价"

#: src/Addons/Coupons/CouponsAddon.php:77
msgid "How this coupon works with quantity discounts. \"Apply on top\" takes the coupon off the tier price. \"Switch tiered prices off\" charges the regular price for the products the coupon covers. \"Skip products\" keeps their tier price and leaves them out of the coupon, like \"Exclude sale items\"."
msgstr "此优惠券如何与数量折扣配合使用。“叠加”会在阶梯价格的基础上再减去优惠券金额。“关闭阶梯价格”会让优惠券涵盖的产品按原价收费。“跳过产品”会保留这些产品的阶梯价格，并将其排除在优惠券之外，类似“排除促销商品”。"

#: src/Addons/Coupons/CouponsAddon.php:203
msgid "This coupon does not apply to products that already have a quantity discount."
msgstr "此优惠券不适用于已有数量折扣的产品。"

#: src/Addons/Coupons/CouponsAddon.php:232
msgid "Choose per coupon whether it applies on top of tiered prices, switches them off, or skips products that already have a tiered price."
msgstr "为每张优惠券选择：叠加在阶梯价格之上、关闭阶梯价格，或跳过已有阶梯价格的产品。"

